# Development

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Aarthirt14/AeroPuzzle.git

cd AeroPuzzle
```

Install in editable mode:

```bash
pip install -e .
```

Build the package:

```bash
pip install build

python -m build
```

Upload to PyPI:

```bash
pip install twine

python -m twine upload dist/*
```

